  "description": "A minimal, production-hardened Mealy machine kernel for building state machines, MVU runtimes, event-sourced aggregates, and actor systems. Define pure domain logic as a transition function — then run it anywhere. Includes the Decider pattern for command validation, a Result type, and a thread-safe async runtime with observer/interpreter extension points.",
